Experiment 008, Apple M2 (MacBook Pro, 8 cores, 8 GB, macOS 26.6.2, Lean v4.27.0-rc1), source 3f797dc.
Five runs of each probe, one fresh process per run, 106 turns per route.

Heartbeats per turn, every run:
  halving first  HALVING  identical across runs: True; turn 0 = 28; turns 1..105 all = {1}; total 133
  halving first  CRANK    identical across runs: True; turn 0 = 18; turns 1..105 all = {1}; total 123
  crank first    HALVING  identical across runs: True; turn 0 = 18; turns 1..105 all = {1}; total 123
  crank first    CRANK    identical across runs: True; turn 0 = 28; turns 1..105 all = {1}; total 133
  blank (the meter around nothing): {7} heartbeats in every run

So: the route that runs first reads 28 on its first turn and the route that runs second reads 18, whichever route it is.
Every other turn of both routes reads 1. By position the totals are 133 and 123; by route, at the same position, they are equal.

Wall time per route, turns 1..105 (ns), median of five runs [min, max]:
  halving first  HALVING    295876  [289959, 1548665]
  halving first  CRANK      907289  [888795, 951708]
  crank first    HALVING    287367  [277290, 308747]
  crank first    CRANK      891377  [854246, 952589]
  crank / halving: 3.07 (halving first), 3.10 (crank first)

Wall time per turn (ns), median over runs, averaged over a range of turns:
  halving first  HALVING  turns 1-7:    1601   8-35:    2376   36-70:    3031   71-105:    3088
  halving first  CRANK    turns 1-7:    8899   8-35:    8857   36-70:    8464   71-105:    8488
  crank first    HALVING  turns 1-7:    1423   8-35:    2253   36-70:    2968   71-105:    3058
  crank first    CRANK    turns 1-7:    8964   8-35:    8348   36-70:    8174   71-105:    8040

MEET: {('true', 'true')}

Against the seal:
 (a) identical across runs: yes. Independent of order: NO. Refuted as sealed: the first-turn count follows the position.
 (b) both routes end on the build's bracket and point: confirmed.
 (c) account A as sealed (first run, halving first): 133 against 123, 7.5 per cent apart: refuted as sealed.
 (d3) account B as sealed: confirmed as sealed.
     Both (c) and (d3) turn on the order effect alone. Route for route at the same position the totals are equal exactly,
     and they are equal because the meter reads its floor, one heartbeat a turn, for both.
 (d1) halving heartbeats flat: confirmed, trivially (all 1).
 (d2) halving wall time per turn grows: see the profile above.
